  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Collaborative and Integrated Disease Surveillance and Response for Enhanced Epidemic and Pandemic Prevention, Detection and Response in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i. To strengthen early warning surveillance systems using all hazard approach  to enhance public health intelligence for timely action, reduce risk and enhance emergency preparedness, response and recovery.
ii. To strengthen diagnostic and laboratory network mechanism for early warning surveillance and timely detection to enhance public health intelligence for timely action, reduce risk and enhance emergency preparedness, response and recovery
iii. Appropriate human resources available in all relevant sectors at national and intermediate levels, to detect, assess, notify, report and respond to events according to IHR provisions.</narrative>
  </description>
